ble resources.\n\nExpert raters disagree on severity: several call the race a Tossup while others rate it Lean or Likely Democratic, averaging out to a modest Democratic tilt. Prediction markets price Castor near two-to-one odds. A July poll showed her up eight points, though it is dated and polling overall is sparse. The forecast lands on a narrow Democratic margin with elevated uncertainty, consistent with a Lean D rating.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.7914, "margin": 4.84}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.7727, "margin": 4.5}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.766, "margin": 4.2}]}